{"lyrics":"[Intro: Juice WRLD]\n[00:10.48]Yeah, ayy, mm\n[Chorus: Juice WRLD]\n[00:12.00]Roll it up, lace it, pop a few to chase it\n[00:15.02]I'm in my own Matrix, none of this shit makes sense\n[00:18.04]All these humans basic, don't got no home trainin'\n[00:20.94]Codeine by the cases, I've been purple rainin'\n[00:23.98]Roll it up, lace it, pop a few, chase it\n[00:26.98]I've been in the Matrix, none of this shit makes sense\n[00:30.04]All you humans basic, you ain't even got home trainin'\n[00:32.94]Codeine by the cases, I've been purple rainin'\n[Verse 1: Juice WRLD]\n[00:35.84]Stressed out, so I tend to take meds (Take meds)\n[00:38.76]Thе Devil told me, \"Good show, break a lеg\" (Break a leg)\n[00:41.62]All these painkillers like I got a pair of broken legs (Broken legs)\n[00:44.62]All these Percs I pop, you'd thought I was plannin' to break my neck\n[00:47.30]Grindin', man, I'm hungry for this shit like I ain't ate yet\n[00:50.04]You wish that you could have what I could have, you could just say that\n[00:53.10]If you ain't my lil' bitch, then bitch, them convos, you can save that\n[00:56.02]These niggas think they invincible 'til they see them bullet holes in they Maybach\n[Chorus: Juice WRLD & Eminem]\n[01:00.00]Roll it up, lace it, pop a few to chase it\n[01:03.00]I'm in my own Matrix, none of this shit makes sense\n[01:06.04]All these humans basic, don't got no home trainin'\n[01:08.94]Codeine by the cases, I've been purple rainin'\n[01:11.98]Roll it up, lace it, pop a few, chase it\n[01:15.04]I've been in the Matrix, none of this shit makes sense\n[01:18.04]All you humans basic, you don't even got home trainin'\n[01:20.94]Codeine by the cases (\n[01:22.12]Yeah\n[01:22.30]), I've been purple rainin'\n[Verse 2: Eminem]\n[01:23.66]You pop some ecstasy first, it gets progressively worse (Yeah)\n[01:26.62]Try your best to reverse (No), unsuccessfully flirtin' with certain death\n[01:30.26]And revertin' to your promethazine urge\n[01:32.50]The fuckin' devil, he lurks, lose your best friend, he smirks\n[01:35.50]Wake up and everything hurts (Ow)\n[01:37.42]And as you spiral downward, listen (Yeah)\n[01:39.30]I know just how it is when (What?)\n[01:40.72]You start slow, then before you notice it, now you're mixin' (What?)\n[01:43.84]Oxy's without prescription (Yeah)\n[01:45.18]Cough medicine, valium with 'em (Damn)\n[01:46.78]But ain't that how addiction sort of works (Uh)\n[01:48.98]They call it lean 'cause you gravitate and lean towards the purp\n[01:51.98]The blessing or the curse of fame\n[01:53.80]'Cause now you can afford the syrup (Damn)\n[01:55.62]Percocet and Percodan, but that ain't what you meant\n[01:57.98]When you said that you're in it for the perks (Nah, damn)\n[02:00.80]Develop a habit out of that\n[02:02.66]Need a Xanax now to rap\n[02:04.02]So you pop it 'fore you record a verse (Ah)\n[02:06.98]Your buzz wear down, yeah\n[02:08.66]Like a rabbit out a hat makes you wanna pull your hair out (Ha)\n[02:12.74]Fentanyl (Yep), Oxy (What?)\n[02:14.26]Demerol, them are all what possibly got Shock G, Roxy\n[02:17.84]Codone and lean is probably what got Lil Peep and ODB\n[02:20.98]So many who OD be way too young to go\n[02:23.46]See me, I was lucky, my escape was narrowin'\n[02:26.82]Do not think I take it for granted, that I'm still here\n[02:29.48]Synthetic heroin, you (What?) tried to kill me, then you\n[02:32.66]Murdered Jarad, didn't you? Piece of shit\n[02:35.26]Thanks to you, now we lost Gangsta Boo and Pimp C, Prince, and Michael, mixing Nyquil\n[02:38.98]With prescription Vic's, addiction's like a fucking vicious cycle\n[02:41.94]Juice, we will forever miss you\n[02:43.64]To the younger generation (Nah)\n[02:45.52]I ain't lecturing you, but man, just be careful when you\n[Chorus: Juice WRLD]\n[02:47.94]Roll it up, lace it, pop a few to chase it\n[02:51.00]I'm in my own Matrix, none of this shit makes sense\n[02:54.04]All these humans basic, don't got no home trainin'\n[02:56.94]Codeine by the cases, I've been purple rainin'\n[03:00.00]Roll it up, lace it, pop a few, chase it\n[03:02.96]I've been in the Matrix, none of this shit makes sense\n[03:06.06]All you humans basic, you don't even got home trainin'\n[03:08.98]Codeine by the cases, I've been purple rainin'\n[Outro: Juice WRLD]\n[03:11.68]I ain't comin' down from this high\n[03:13.70]Ain't finna let nobody kill my vibe\n[03:24.90]They committed social suicide\n[03:30.26]But me? I refuse to die (I refuse to die)\n[03:31.44]I will never come down from this high\n[03:32.90]I won't let them kill none of my vibes\n[03:34.12]They committed social suicide\n[03:35.14]Me? I can never ever die, I can never ever die","words":[[10.48,10.8,"Yeah,"],[10.84,10.9,"ayy,"],[11.36,11.96,"mm"],[12.0,12.16,"Roll"],[12.26,12.36,"it"],[12.42,12.44,"up,"],[12.74,13.14,"lace"],[13.18,13.42,"it,"],[13.46,13.64,"pop"],[13.72,13.72,"a"],[13.82,13.94,"few"],[14.02,14.06,"to"],[14.18,14.68,"chase"],[14.92,14.96,"it"],[15.02,15.1,"I'm"],[15.16,15.18,"in"],[15.3,15.46,"my"],[15.54,15.62,"own"],[15.7,16.28,"Matrix,"],[16.46,16.62,"none"],[16.7,16.72,"of"],[16.78,16.92,"this"],[16.98,17.16,"shit"],[17.24,17.52,"makes"],[17.58,17.94,"sense"],[18.04,18.1,"All"],[18.14,18.38,"these"],[18.42,18.64,"humans"],[18.72,19.36,"basic,"],[19.48,19.6,"don't"],[19.64,19.78,"got"],[19.82,19.96,"no"],[20.04,20.12,"home"],[20.18,20.9,"trainin'"],[20.94,21.26,"Codeine"],[21.3,21.34,"by"],[21.48,21.54,"the"],[21.66,22.34,"cases,"],[22.38,22.52,"I've"],[22.62,22.72,"been"],[22.8,23.06,"purple"],[23.22,23.62,"rainin'"],[23.98,24.18,"Roll"],[24.26,24.36,"it"],[24.44,24.68,"up,"],[24.76,25.2,"lace"],[25.24,25.26,"it,"],[25.48,25.68,"pop"],[25.74,25.74,"a"],[25.84,25.98,"few,"],[26.22,26.7,"chase"],[26.92,26.94,"it"],[26.98,27.04,"I've"],[27.16,27.34,"been"],[27.4,27.5,"in"],[27.54,27.58,"the"],[27.72,28.34,"Matrix,"],[28.5,28.64,"none"],[28.72,28.74,"of"],[28.8,28.86,"this"],[29.0,29.12,"shit"],[29.26,29.54,"makes"],[29.6,29.74,"sense"],[30.04,30.12,"All"],[30.18,30.